# Jet, Freedom Fighter: the damage is "equal to the number of creatures you control" as it resolves. Bot1 controls only Ornithopter and
# Jet (two) while Bot2 controls Hill Giant and Ornithopter, so Jet deals 2 and the 3/3 Hill Giant survives with 2 damage marked. "When
# Jet dies, put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures": Bot2 Bolts Jet and Bot1 chooses no target, so nothing grows.

